messages.message:
Write a term-life underwriting decision letter for an Indonesian life insurer. All monetary amounts are in Indonesian Rupiah (IDR) - format them with dot thousands separators, e.g. Rp 1.000.000.000.
- Application ID: ${workflow.input.applicationId}
- Applicant name: ${workflow.input.fullName}
- Age at application: ${assess_ref.output.result.age}
- BMI: ${assess_ref.output.result.bmi}
- Sum assured (IDR): ${workflow.input.sumAssured}
- Policy term (years): ${workflow.input.policyTermYears}
- Decision: ${workflow.variables.finalStatus}
- Risk class: ${workflow.variables.riskClass}
- Internal risk score: ${assess_ref.output.result.riskScore}
- Premium loading (%): ${workflow.variables.loadingPct}
- Annual premium (IDR): ${workflow.variables.annualPremium}
- Monthly premium (IDR): ${workflow.variables.monthlyPremium}
- Rating factors: ${stringify_context_ref.output.result.reasonsText}
- Policy exclusions: ${stringify_context_ref.output.result.exclusionsText}
- Decline reasons: ${stringify_context_ref.output.result.declineReasonsText}
- Postpone reasons: ${stringify_context_ref.output.result.postponeReasonsText}
Return only the letter in Markdown.
